.SS 🔗 2. UNIX 管道串接範例 (UNIX Pipe Recipes)
.SS Recipe A: 研究計畫履約期與法定工作日計算 (G01 ↔ G40)
.IP
.EX
\&./pa g01 search\-grb \-k \(dq水利\(dq \-n 1 \-j \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  jq \-r \(aq.results[0] | \(dq\(rs(.start_date) \(rs(.end_date)\(dq\(aq \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  xargs ./pa g40 range \-j \f[B]|\f[R] jq \(aq{workdays: .total_working_days, holidays: .total_holidays}\(aq
.EE
.SS Recipe B: 計畫發布機關歷史改制回溯 (G01 ↔ G30)
.IP
.EX
\&./pa g01 search\-grb \-k \(dq農田水利\(dq \-n 1 \-j \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  jq \-r \(aq.results[0].agency_name\(aq \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  ./pa g30 resolve\-org \-\-stdin \-j
.EE
.PP
